# Tree query callback for continuous collision, ported from
# b2ContinuousQueryCallback in solver.c. The world owns one instance reused
# per sweep; QueryTo mutates the shared context fraction on a hit.
Class ContinuousQueryCallback Inherits TreeQueryCallback
## Owning world.
Property World As World
## Shared sweep context.
Property Context As ContinuousContext

## Tests one candidate shape against the fast body's sweep.
Override Function VisitLeaf(proxyId As Integer, userData As Integer) As Boolean
Pragma Unused proxyId
Return Me.World.ContinuousHitTest(userData, Me.Context)
End Function
End Class
